        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Björn Ulvaeus\n- Groups: ABBA\n- Songs: \"That's Me\", \"I Wonder (Departure)\", \"She's My Kind of Girl\"\n- Places: Antwerp\n\nFacts:\n- Björn Ulvaeus was born in Antwerp on 16 December 1946.\n- ABBA released \"That's Me\" with \"I Wonder (Departure)\" as its B-side.\n- Björn Ulvaeus wrote the song on the B-side of ABBA's \"That's Me\".\n- Björn Ulvaeus also wrote and performed \"She's My Kind of Girl\".",
